MDX comment \`{/* slidev: … */}\`); **warning** — it shows, but differently; **note** — carried over
in Kadal's spelling, or dropped because Kadal does it another way.

## The deck

- **error** (components/Connections.vue) Connections.vue has script logic the importer does not convert (import { autoResetRef } from '@vueuse/core'; watch(a, () => a2c.value = true); watch(b, () => b2c.value = true)); it is a stub that renders its markup, without the 13 bindings and expressions that read its script. Finish it by hand in its .tsx (marked TODO).
- **error** (components/DarkToggle.vue) DarkToggle.vue has script logic the importer does not convert (import { useDarkMode } from '@slidev/client'; const { isDark, toggleDark } = useDarkMode()); it is a stub that renders its markup, without the 3 bindings and expressions that read its script. Finish it by hand in its .tsx (marked TODO).
- **error** (components/NumBox.vue) NumBox.vue has script logic the importer does not convert (import { useVModel } from '@vueuse/core'; const emit = defineEmits<{); it is a stub that renders its markup. Finish it by hand in its .tsx (marked TODO).
"
